@startuml attendance-flow
title Attendance confirmation flow

|Professor|
start
:Open attendance session;

|System|
:Generate temporary code;
:Generate QR representation;
:Store code hash and expiry;

|Student|
:Enter code or scan QR;

|System|
:Find open session;
if (Session open and unexpired?) then (yes)
  if (Student actively enrolled?) then (yes)
    :Hash submitted code;
    if (Code or QR valid?) then (yes)
      if (Already confirmed?) then (yes)
        :Reject as duplicate;
      else (no)
        :Create attendance record;
        :Log accepted attempt;
        :Show attendance confirmed;
      endif
    else (no)
      :Log invalid attempt;
      :Show invalid or expired code;
    endif
  else (no)
    :Log not-enrolled attempt;
    :Reject confirmation;
  endif
else (no)
  :Reject closed or expired session;
endif
stop
@enduml
